{
	quest.048328EEBEEC9C94.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Hazmat Suit&r is essential when working with &aradioactive materials&r."
		""
		"The full set protects you from accidental &cradiation leaks&r, keeping you safe while working around your &dNuclear Reactor&r and handling its waste."
		""
		"You’ll want the &6whole set&r before getting anywhere near the dangerous stuff."
	]
	quest.048328EEBEEC9C94.quest_subtitle: "Stay Protected"
	quest.048328EEBEEC9C94.title: "Hazmat"
	quest.04C21F7B2F034772.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSupercharged Coil&r is what turns the SPS into an &bantimatter&r machine."
		""
		"Place them on the inner center of each face, pointing toward the middle. They focus immense amounts of &benergy&r onto a pressurized source of &bPolonium Gas&r, breaking apart the heavy atoms and producing &dAntimatter&r."
		""
		"Once these are in place, the SPS can finally reach its true potential."
	]
	quest.04C21F7B2F034772.quest_subtitle: "Power Beyond Limits"
	quest.04C21F7B2F034772.title: "Supercharged Coil"
	quest.0C1C61B4554B38E5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCombiner&r allows you to &6combine items&r into useful new materials."
		""
		"You can combine a &dGem&r with &7Stone&r to create &8ore&r, &eWax&r with &6Copper&r to protect it from the elements, mix &dyes&r, and much more."
		""
		"Check your &dEMI&r to discover all the recipes and possibilities the &bCombiner&r has to offer."
	]
	quest.0C1C61B4554B38E5.quest_subtitle: "Put the pieces together"
	quest.0C1C61B4554B38E5.title: "Combiner"
	quest.110B0C8DD2FD5BE7.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &aMekanism&r, where raw resources become the fuel for incredible automation."
		""
		"You’ll &6create&r and &6upgrade&r powerful &bmachines&r to process &7solids&r, &bliquids&r, &9gases&r, and &eenergy&r on an ever-increasing scale. Start small, then work your way toward advanced factories, massive power generation, and high-tech equipment."
		""
		"Make sure to use your &dEMI&r to explore &6recipes&r, &bprocessing chains&r, and the many ways Mekanism materials can be transformed."
		""
		"Keep an eye out for &3Osmium&r - one of Mekanism’s most important &3resources&r. It forms the foundation of many &a machines&r, &acircuits&r, and &aupgrades&r you’ll rely on throughout your progression."
		""
		"From basic &bore processing&r to &5fission&r, &5fusion&r, and &dantimatter&r, there’s a lot to discover."
		""
		"&6Build bigger. &bProcess faster. &aPush Mekanism to its limits.&r"
	]
	quest.110B0C8DD2FD5BE7.quest_subtitle: "Harness the power of advanced technology"
	quest.110B0C8DD2FD5BE7.title: "&fWelcome to &aMekanism"
	quest.117C9FABE86447D1.quest_desc: [
		"The &bQuantum Entangloporter&r lets you &6transport&r items, &7liquids&r, &eGases&r, &cheat&r, &dPigments&r, &9slurries&r, &ainfuse types&r, and &6energy&r instantly across any distance."
		""
		"Just like the &bTeleporter&r, it lets you connect distant locations without worrying about the distance between them."
	]
	quest.117C9FABE86447D1.quest_subtitle: "Instant Logistics"
	quest.117C9FABE86447D1.title: "Quantum Entangloporter"
	quest.17C1F2791A6E0676.quest_desc: [
		"Mekanism offers several upgrades to customize your machines. Install them through the machine's &bUpgrade&r tab or &6shift + right-click&r the machine with an upgrade."
		""
		"&bSpeed Upgrade&r"
		"Increases processing speed, but dramatically increases &eFE usage&r. Up to &a16&r can be installed."
		""
		"&eEnergy Upgrade&r"
		"Increases energy capacity while reducing the machine's &eFE/t&r consumption. These are especially useful alongside &bSpeed Upgrades&r."
		""
		"&dGas Upgrade&r"
		"Improves the efficiency of machines that consume gases, reducing their gas requirements."
		""
		"&7Muffling Upgrade&r"
		"Reduces the noise produced by machines. Up to &a4&r can be installed, completely silencing them."
		""
		"&6Filter Upgrade&r"
		"Used by the &bElectric Pump&r to separate &9Water&r from &bHeavy Water&r."
		""
		"&cAnchor Upgrade&r"
		"Keeps supported machines' chunks loaded, allowing them to continue working when you're away."
		""
		"&aStone Generator Upgrade&r"
		"Gives the &bDigital Miner&r an infinite supply of &7Stone&r and &8Cobblestone&r for its replace functionality."
		""
		"Choose your upgrades carefully - a well-balanced machine can be far more efficient than one simply loaded with &bSpeed Upgrades&r."
	]
	quest.17C1F2791A6E0676.quest_subtitle: "Tune your machines to perfection"
	quest.17C1F2791A6E0676.title: "Machine Upgrades"
	quest.17E7640F55666577.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPigment Extractor&r allows you to take almost any &adye-colored&r object and &6extract the dye&r from it."
		""
		"The process destroys the dyed object, leaving behind the original &7undyed&r version along with the extracted dye."
	]
	quest.17E7640F55666577.quest_subtitle: "Give color a second life"
	quest.1B65CA6898CC3F9E.quest_desc: [
		"Tier Installers let you upgrade compatible &eMekanism&r machines directly in-world, without breaking them down and rebuilding them."
		""
		"Simply &6sneak + right-click&r a machine with the appropriate &bTier Installer&r to turn it into its Factory equivalent."
		""
		"Each installer upgrades the machine by &6one tier&r at a time:"
		""
		"&2Basic&r → &cAdvanced&r → &bElite&r → &dUltimate&r"
		""
		"You cannot skip tiers, so keep your machines upgraded as your factory grows."
	]
	quest.1B65CA6898CC3F9E.quest_subtitle: "Upgrade your production line"
	quest.1B65CA6898CC3F9E.title: "Tier Installers"
	quest.1D482F0D9AF8D17E.quest_desc: [
		"The &dAtomic Alloy&r is the strongest and most conductive alloy you can create."
		""
		"It’s made by &6infusing &5Refined Obsidian&r into &bReinforced Alloy&r, producing a material capable of handling the most demanding machinery."
	]
	quest.1D482F0D9AF8D17E.quest_subtitle: "The peak of alloy technology"
	quest.1D482F0D9AF8D17E.title: "Atomic Alloy"
	quest.1F9A1456487655B0.quest_desc: [
		"Using your &bTeleportation Core&r, construct a &9Teleporter&r to travel instantly between distant locations."
		""
		"Each &bTeleporter Portal&r requires one &9Teleporter&r and &b9 Teleporter Frames&r, leaving a two-block-wide opening for you to walk through."
		""
		"&6Configure&r your destination, step through the portal, and off you go!"
	]
	quest.1F9A1456487655B0.quest_subtitle: "Instant Travel"
	quest.1F9A1456487655B0.title: "Teleporter"
	quest.21586F8B123BFCC3.quest_desc: [
		"The &bWaste Barrel&r provides a simple way to deal with excess &anuclear fluids&r."
		""
		"Over time, it will slowly allow the stored waste to &adecay&r at a fixed rate, letting you safely reduce your radioactive waste without any additional processing."
	]
	quest.21586F8B123BFCC3.quest_subtitle: "A Slow Solution"
	quest.21586F8B123BFCC3.title: "True Power and True Pain"
	quest.21E51BEA3B8E3EDC.quest_desc: [
		"&8Steel&r!"
		""
		"The &bSteel Ingot&r is one of the most important materials in your &6Mekanism&r progression."
		""
		"You’ll need it for &aalmost everything&r - from &bmachines&r and &bcomponents&r to larger &6multiblock structures&r."
		""
		"Steel is produced by &6double infusing&r &7Iron&r with &8Coal&r, then &6smelting&r the resulting product into a Steel Ingot."
		""
		"Get used to making it. You’ll be making a lot of steel."
	]
	quest.21E51BEA3B8E3EDC.quest_subtitle: "The backbone of Mekanism"
	quest.21E51BEA3B8E3EDC.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.21EE3862F6DA8E09.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPrecision Sawmill&r is a machine designed to process &9logs&r and other wood-based materials with &eextreme efficiency&r."
		""
		"It produces &9sawdust&r as a byproduct, giving you an extra material to put to use in your processing chains."
	]
	quest.21EE3862F6DA8E09.quest_subtitle: "Turn logs into lumber and more"
	quest.21EE3862F6DA8E09.title: "Precision Sawmill"
	quest.22D2716905D415E5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bEnrichment Chamber&r is a versatile machine that can &6enrich ores&r into two or more &bDusts&r, while also handling many other useful recipes."
		""
		"You can use it for things like:"
		""
		"Flowers into dusts"
		"Removing moss from blocks"
		"Removing oxidation"
		"And much more!"
		""
		"Tip: &6Enrich&r your &dinfuse types&r such as coal, redstone, diamonds, and refined obsidian to get more &binfuse material&r than you would from the plain gem or dust."
	]
	quest.22D2716905D415E5.quest_subtitle: "Turn ordinary resources into something more"
	quest.22D2716905D415E5.title: "Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.247E497BC6DE25CE.quest_desc: [
		"The &bRobit&r is a handy little robot that can follow you around and help with all sorts of tasks."
		""
		"It can act as a &9crafting table&r, &7furnace&r, &7anvil&r, &6chest&r, and more — all while being a little companion on your adventures."
		""
		"Best of all, this little guy is completely &cfireproof&r, so you don't have to worry about him getting himself into too much trouble."
	]
	quest.247E497BC6DE25CE.quest_subtitle: "Your Little Helper"
	quest.247E497BC6DE25CE.title: "Robit"
	quest.27B6C6079B5FE918.quest_desc: [
		"The &bRotary Condensentrator&r lets you convert &egases&r into their &bliquid&r form, or &6condense&r liquids back into gases."
		""
		"Use the &6button&r in the top-left of the GUI to switch between the two modes."
		""
		"This machine is especially useful when a recipe requires a chemical in a different &bstate&r, letting you move between &egases&r and &bliquids&r as needed."
		""
		"Same chemical. Different state. More possibilities."
	]
	quest.27B6C6079B5FE918.quest_subtitle: "Turn gases into liquids"
	quest.27B6C6079B5FE918.title: "Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.2A68AB7D1EDD44BD.quest_desc: [
		"&bStructural Glass&r is a versatile block that can replace most blocks in a &emultiblock&r while keeping the structure fully visible."
		""
		"It’s especially useful for &bDynamic Tanks&r, letting you see the fluids inside while keeping the tank’s outer frame intact."
		""
		"Use Structural Glass wherever you want to &6watch your machines work&r without sacrificing functionality."
		""
		"If you built something complicated, you might as well make it look cool."
	]
	quest.2A68AB7D1EDD44BD.quest_subtitle: "See through your multiblocks"
	quest.2A68AB7D1EDD44BD.title: "Structural Glass"
	quest.3392424E7E1B68C4.quest_desc: [
		"Need a &bcentrifuge&r? Need a &afaster&r one?"
		""
		"How about one that &6spins like a rocket&r strapped to a &9playground roundabout&r?"
		""
		"The &bIsotopic Centrifuge&r is the solution!"
		""
		"Use it to process &anuclear waste&r and create the &dfissile fuel&r needed to power your &cNuclear Reactor&r."
	]
	quest.3392424E7E1B68C4.quest_subtitle: "Spin It Up"
	quest.3392424E7E1B68C4.title: "Isotopic Centrifuge"
	quest.34B822EC25F66B54.quest_desc: ["The &bOsmium Compressor&r is used to &6compress&r &3osmium&r into certain dusts to &6create&r their ingot counterparts."]
	quest.34B822EC25F66B54.title: "Osmium Compressor"
	quest.3B0AB80C9FAD48F2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bAntiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer&r uses &dAntimatter&r to fundamentally alter the molecular structure of certain materials."
		""
		"Feed it the right ingredients and it can transform them into more &6powerful&r variants, unlocking some of the strongest materials and upgrades available."
	]
	quest.3B0AB80C9FAD48F2.quest_subtitle: "The Power of Antimatter"
	quest.3B0AB80C9FAD48F2.title: "Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer"
	quest.3BAA7EC7653A7905.quest_desc: [
		"The &bChemical Injection Chamber&r takes &9ores&r and &craw ores&r and processes them with &7Hydrogen Chloride&r into multiple &eshards&r, marking the first step toward &a400% ore processing&r."
		""
		"It also has plenty of other useful applications. Use &7oxygen&r to &coxidize&r certain copper materials, turn water vapor into solid concrete, reverse the cooking of clay, and even re-hydrate dead coral."
	]
	quest.3BAA7EC7653A7905.quest_subtitle: "The gateway to fourfold ore processing"
	quest.3BAA7EC7653A7905.title: "Chemical Injection Chamber"
	quest.3F6174E82DDC48C3.quest_desc: [
		"The &bEnergized Smelter&r is a simple &6powered furnace&r used to &6smelt&r items and blocks into their &7cooked&r counterparts."
		""
		"It's your go-to machine for faster, automated smelting without relying on a traditional furnace."
	]
	quest.3F6174E82DDC48C3.quest_subtitle: "Smelt your way to progress"
	quest.3F6174E82DDC48C3.title: "Energized Smelter"
	quest.40EB78C0AF30096E.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMetallurgic Infuser&r is one of the first machines you’ll make, and it introduces one of Mekanism’s most important mechanics: &6infusion&r."
		""
		"It combines &bmetals&r with different &dinfuse types&r to create advanced materials used throughout your progression."
		""
		"Get familiar with the machine’s &3configuration&r options early. You can control which sides &aaccept inputs&r, &coutput&r products, &eaccept energy&r, or do nothing for each resource type."
		""
		"The &3energy statistics&r tab shows useful information about the machine’s &eenergy usage&r, while the &6redstone control&r settings let you decide how it responds to redstone signals."
		""
		"You’ll also find the &btransport&r tab, which works alongside &bLogistical Transporters&r to help &6filter&r and &aroute items&r automatically."
		""
		"Master the basics now, because these machines are the foundation of everything that follows."
	]
	quest.40EB78C0AF30096E.quest_subtitle: "Learn the machinery that makes it all work"
	quest.40EB78C0AF30096E.title: "&eThe Basics"
	quest.41604B0C59094F5E.quest_desc: [
		"The &bMekaSuit&r is Mekanism's ultimate set of modular armor. Unlike normal armor, it has no durability - it runs entirely on &eFE&r."
		""
		"Each piece can be customized with &dModules&r using the &eModification Station&r. Modules can provide everything from flight and enhanced movement to automatic feeding, radiation protection and powerful defensive abilities."
		""
		"The &bMekaSuit&r becomes incredibly powerful when fully upgraded, but every ability comes at the cost of energy. Keep your armor charged to make the most of it."
		""
		"And don't forget the &bMeka-Tool&r! This modular powerhouse combines the functions of multiple tools into one, with modules for &6vein mining&r, &dSilk Touch&r, &ccombat&r, &aexcavation&r, &eore processing&r and more."
		""
		"Both are upgraded at the &eModification Station&r, letting you build the perfect loadout for your playstyle."
	]
	quest.41604B0C59094F5E.quest_subtitle: "Become the machine"
	quest.41604B0C59094F5E.title: "MekaSuit"
	quest.4351715A36CA0DA6.quest_desc: [
		"The &bNutritional Liquifier&r lets you &6grind down&r almost any food item into &dNutritional Paste&r."
		""
		"This &dNutritional Paste&r can be stored in bulk as a &bliquid&r, making it much easier to handle large amounts of food without filling your storage with stacks of individual items."
		""
		"You can also use the dedicated slot to fill &bCanteens&r with &dNutritional Paste&r, giving you a convenient way to carry it around and consume it when needed."
		""
		"Your food goes in. Nutritional Paste comes out. No chewing required."
	]
	quest.4351715A36CA0DA6.quest_subtitle: "Turn food into fuel"
	quest.4351715A36CA0DA6.title: "Nutritional Liquifier"
	quest.44D8D30BCD48C4C9.quest_desc: [
		"The &bElite Control Circuit&r is a &bdiamond-coated circuit board&r with a pulsating &cInfused Alloy&r core."
		""
		"Its advanced design can handle the &6processing power&r required for calculations of a much &cmore demanding level&r, making it essential for &bhigh-tier Mekanism machinery&r."
	]
	quest.44D8D30BCD48C4C9.quest_subtitle: "Power for the machines that mean business"
	quest.44D8D30BCD48C4C9.title: "Elite Control Circuit"
	quest.45E16D69D7099581.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the age of &bSteel Casings&r!"
		""
		"From this point onward, most &bMekanism machines&r will require a Steel Casing to &6support&r and contain&r the &ccircuitry&r and &7mechanics&r inside."
		""
		"They’re a core part of your &6progression&r, so get comfortable crafting them - you’ll be seeing a lot of Steel Casings as you work your way through Mekanism."
		""
		"No steel casing, no machine."
	]
	quest.45E16D69D7099581.quest_subtitle: "The foundation of every machine"
	quest.45E16D69D7099581.title: "Steel Casing"
	quest.462944FD21A92AED.quest_desc: [
		"&cInfused Alloy&r is the first alloy you’ll produce for your &6Mekanism&r machines."
		""
		"It’s created by &6infusing &credstone&r into &6Copper&r, producing a highly conductive material used throughout Mekanism’s &acircuitry&r and machine components."
		""
		"You’ll be crafting plenty of these as you progress, so it’s worth keeping a steady supply of &cRedstone&r and &6Copper&r on hand."
		""
		"Your machines need circuits. Your circuits need alloys."
	]
	quest.462944FD21A92AED.quest_subtitle: "Power your circuits with conductive alloys"
	quest.462944FD21A92AED.title: "Infused Alloy"
	quest.478A6A8ADA223AEF.quest_desc: [
		"The &bCanteen&r is used to store &dNutritional Paste&r and lets you consume it on the go."
		""
		"As you eat the &dPaste&r, it will fill your hunger bar as needed rather than wasting any excess."
		""
		"The &bCanteen&r can hold up to &b64,000 mb&r of &dNutritional Paste&r, giving you a massive supply of food in a single container."
		""
		"Each time you consume &dPaste&r, it uses &b128 mb&r, regardless of how much hunger you need to restore."
	]
	quest.478A6A8ADA223AEF.quest_subtitle: "Portable nutrition, wherever you go"
	quest.478A6A8ADA223AEF.title: "Canteen"
	quest.5021D7D55A0B3533.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to &bChemistry&r!"
		""
		"Mekanism’s &6chemical processing&r lets you transform ordinary resources into powerful &bchemicals&r, &egases&r, and other useful materials."
		""
		"You’ll work with everything from simple &bchemical reactions&r to increasingly complex processing chains. Many of Mekanism’s more advanced machines and recipes will depend on the chemicals you produce along the way."
		""
		"Keep your &bChemical Tanks&r, &bPressurized Tubes&r, and processing machines ready - things are about to get &6volatile&r."
		""
		"Time to start mixing things you probably shouldn’t."
	]
	quest.5021D7D55A0B3533.quest_subtitle: "Turn resources into reactions"
	quest.5021D7D55A0B3533.title: "Time for Chemistry!"
	quest.508A650402DC24F5.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSPS Casing&r forms the core structure of the &bSupercritical Phase Shifter&r, built to withstand the extreme conditions required to generate &bAntimatter&r."
		""
		"It’s expensive, but you’ll need it if you want to take your &benergy production&r to the next level."
	]
	quest.508A650402DC24F5.quest_subtitle: "Push energy to its limits"
	quest.508A650402DC24F5.title: "SPS Casing"
	quest.534B63750942C433.quest_desc: [
		"Your first step into &6Mekanism&r's circuitry is the &bBasic Control Circuit&r."
		""
		"These compact components are crafted by &cinfusing &3Osmium&r with &credstone&r, and they form the foundation of many Mekanism machines and components."
		""
		"You’ll be using &bControl Circuits&r throughout your progression, with more advanced tiers unlocking as you progress further into Mekanism."
		""
		"Make plenty. You’re going to need them."
	]
	quest.534B63750942C433.quest_subtitle: "The brains behind your machines"
	quest.534B63750942C433.title: "Basic Control Circuit"
	quest.550B874D9F2D0D5A.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDigital Miner&r is an automated mining machine that lets you gather resources without manually digging out every block."
		""
		"Use its &econfigurable filters&r to target specific &9blocks&r or entire tags, giving you precise control over what it mines."
		""
		"With a maximum radius of &a32 blocks&r, you can cover a sizeable area while keeping your resource collection fully automated."
		""
		"Need to check a block’s tag? Your &bDictionary&r has you covered."
	]
	quest.550B874D9F2D0D5A.quest_subtitle: "Automated Mining"
	quest.550B874D9F2D0D5A.title: "Digital Miner"
	quest.566D039774A4DB9D.quest_desc: [
		"Create &bPlutonium Pellets&r by repurposing &anuclear waste&r and combining it with &bfluorite dust&r."
		""
		"These pellets can then be used to produce &bFissile Fuel&r, turning your radioactive waste into something much more useful."
	]
	quest.566D039774A4DB9D.quest_subtitle: "Turning Waste into Fuel"
	quest.566D039774A4DB9D.title: "Plutonium Pellet"
	quest.56C5ECD3430B6A55.quest_desc: [
		"The &bHDPE Reinforced Elytra&r is a direct upgrade to the regular &delytra&r, offering &a2x the durability&r for longer flights."
		""
		"It can also be repaired using &7HDPE Sheets&r, with each sheet restoring &b25% of its durability&r."
		""
		"A little extra reinforcement goes a long way when you're planning on spending a lot of time in the air."
	]
	quest.56C5ECD3430B6A55.quest_subtitle: "Built to Last"
	quest.56C5ECD3430B6A55.title: "HDPE Reinforced Elytra"
	quest.59451B5DAD78C46F.quest_desc: [
		"The &bAtomic Disassembler&r is the ultimate tool for breaking down blocks, machines, and just about anything else in your way."
		""
		"It’s an all-in-one tool with a wide range of uses, and it can pack one &cserious punch&r when you need to deal some damage."
	]
	quest.59451B5DAD78C46F.quest_subtitle: "The Ultimate Tool"
	quest.59451B5DAD78C46F.title: "Atomic Disassembler"
	quest.5BDE55C11519F7F7.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPurification Chamber&r is the first step in &a300% ore processing&r, using &7oxygen&r to purify &braw ores&r, &eore shards&r, and other materials into &cclumps&r."
		""
		"From here, your &9ore processing chain&r can continue through further stages to multiply the resources you get from every ore."
	]
	quest.5BDE55C11519F7F7.quest_subtitle: "The first step toward maximum efficiency"
	quest.5BDE55C11519F7F7.title: "Purification Chamber"
	quest.5F95D00149FB24FD.quest_desc: [
		"The &bChemical Dissolution Chamber&r takes an &9ore&r and chemically &6dissolves&r it, separating the useful material from its impurities."
		""
		"The result is an unprocessed &dslurry of ore&r, ready to be cleaned and refined through the next stages of your &aore processing&r chain."
	]
	quest.5F95D00149FB24FD.quest_subtitle: "Breaking Down the Ore"
	quest.5F95D00149FB24FD.title: "Chemical Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.5FFDA262D7693860.quest_desc: [
		"Create &aPolonium Pellets&r by repurposing &anuclear waste&r and combining it with &bfluorite dust&r."
